I guess Holmes would gloat in person, and Moriarty would go

114
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:50,980
and gloat by sending, putting like an ad in the Times

115
00:04:50,980 --> 00:04:53,240
of London or something saying, ha, ha, Holmes,

116
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:56,040
you thought that you would catch me, but I outwitted you.

117
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:58,000
And the real thing, no one outwitted anybody.

118
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:01,120
All that happened is they threw the dice, and the dice came out,

119
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,420
favorably for Holmes.

